<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Representing data using a grouped frequency distribution table</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>The following data represents the exam scores of <strong>{@total_students@}</strong> students in a mathematics class:</p>
<p style="background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-family: monospace; font-size: 1.1em; line-height: 1.6;">
    {@data_str@}
</p>
<p>Construct a <strong>grouped frequency distribution table</strong> using the class intervals below.</p>
<table class="table table-bordered table-striped" style="width: 60%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead style="background-color: #e0e0e0;">
        <tr><th style="text-align: center;">Score Interval</th><th style="text-align: center;">Frequency</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;">{@c1_min@} &#8211; {@c1_max@}</td>
            <td style="text-align: center;">[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;">{@c2_min@} &#8211; {@c2_max@}</td>
            <td style="text-align: center;">[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;">{@c3_min@} &#8211; {@c3_max@}</td>
            <td style="text-align: center;">[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;">{@c4_min@} &#8211; {@c4_max@}</td>
            <td style="text-align: center;">[[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]] [[feedback:prt4]]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center;">{@c5_min@} &#8211; {@c5_max@}</td>
            <td style="text-align: center;">[[input:ans5]] [[validation:ans5]] [[feedback:prt5]]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #f2f2f2;">
            <td style="text-align: right; padding-right: 20px;">Total</td>
            <td style="text-align: center;">[[input:ans_total]] [[validation:ans_total]] [[feedback:prt_total]]</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<h4>Worked solution</h4>
<p>Tally the scores that fall into each range (endpoints included):</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>{@c1_min@} &#8211; {@c1_max@}:</strong> scores in the 40s &rarr; <strong>{@f1@}</strong>.</li>
<li><strong>{@c2_min@} &#8211; {@c2_max@}:</strong> scores in the 50s &rarr; <strong>{@f2@}</strong>.</li>
<li><strong>{@c3_min@} &#8211; {@c3_max@}:</strong> scores in the 60s &rarr; <strong>{@f3@}</strong>.</li>
<li><strong>{@c4_min@} &#8211; {@c4_max@}:</strong> scores in the 70s &rarr; <strong>{@f4@}</strong>.</li>
<li><strong>{@c5_min@} &#8211; {@c5_max@}:</strong> scores in the 80s &rarr; <strong>{@f5@}</strong>.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Total:</strong> {@f1@}+{@f2@}+{@f3@}+{@f4@}+{@f5@} = <strong>{@total_students@}</strong>.</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
